Two test scripts come from other Chimera cores, with their terms:
tests/make-testprog.py and the files beside it that read its results
(results.py, sgb-screen.py, make-project.py, run-frontend.sh and its
helpers) are from chimera-core-gambatte, under the MIT licence;
tests/make-gb-test.py is from chimera-core-mesen, under the GPL version 3.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Gearboy (extern/gearboy, a submodule) is Ignacio Sanchez's Game Boy, Game
Boy Color and Super Game Boy emulator, under the GNU General Public License,
version 3 or later (extern/gearboy/LICENSE). It carries Shay Green's
Gb_Snd_Emu, its sound chip, under the GNU Lesser General Public License,
version 2.1 or later (licenses/gb_snd_emu-LGPL-2.1.txt), and Rich
Geldreich's miniz under the MIT licence (licenses/miniz-MIT.txt). The files
under patches/ are changes to Gearboy and are under its licence.

The built package, gearboy.chimeraCore, holds Gearboy compiled together with
this repository's program, and is distributed under the GNU General Public
License version 3 or later. It holds no boot ROM, no Super Game Boy
cartridge and no game.
